In this repository, we simulated the envelope of the electric field and the electron density in "full" configuration. Meaning that the coordinate system that
we chose was z, x, y. The variation along t was introduced artificially through rho. 

In the propagation equation for the envelope of the electric field, the GVD was neglected (taken to be very small). 

The sweep goes from 0.1 * Pcr to 20 * Pcr, with increments of 0.1 * Pcr
